  35:     NCT02207725 Part I: placebo -20.71 (n=9),  andexanet -93.86 (n=24)
  36:                         -93.86 - (-20.71) = -73.15  -> the ledger's  73.15
  37: Both reproduce EXACTLY. The stored figure is an absolute mean difference in
  38: percent-change units, with its sign stripped, written into a hazard-ratio field.
